◇ Test "R-SYN-6: an id's holders keep the first apart, promote another when it leaves, and report none when the last leaves" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-6: a job's index of its interests by id follows every change to its interests" started.
◇ Test "R-NET-6: a 404 for content an apply already bound never fails the asset that holds it" started.
