◇ Test "R-SYN-4: a binding the engine remembers but the store no longer holds sends the waiter down the job path, never a wrong answer" started.
◇ Test "R-CAR-3: a prefetch member whose asset an apply binds to content already present is done, and nothing is downloaded again" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-12: a store view refused as possibly older than the copy is read again, so the engine still follows the store" started.
◇ Test "R-CLN-3: an attempt that fails for lack of space leaves no partial without a sidecar in staging" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-6: a run whose planned asset another apply binds to content already present counts it as fetched and downloads nothing" started.
