◇ Test "R-NET-6: a 404 never marks failed an asset the store bound to that content while the transfer ran" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-6: a run does not download an asset another interest committed after its plan, and counts it as fetched" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-4: a waiter whose asset an apply binds to content already present is answered from the store and downloads nothing" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-5: an ensureAvailable member waiting for a short throttle is answered once a later 429 extends the throttle beyond interactiveMaxWait" started.
◇ Test "R-SYN-6: with the default tuning, a run does not download an asset the store holds present after a failed apply dropped the ledger" started.
